From ab28a7a5d6537b81918b581370a59239da45c586 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 13:54:31 -0800
Subject: [PATCH] EverDrive PRO: Sapphire CD32X's FPGA cell store, a test model
 (ARES_CELLS)

The store follows the SH2's frame count (register 0xca), locks at the boundary after a release (0xc8),
serves the live and frozen cells at cart 0x170000 / 0x194000 and answers only after the unlock (0xcb = 0xa5, 0x5a).
Off unless ARES_CELLS is set.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01NuNYgMfRuDG9Mw67wd4uwV
